<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ESCARTIN WINS SIXTH STAGE OF THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ESCARTIN WINS SIXTH STAGE OF THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>PLAYA DE ARO, Spain 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fernando Escartin</p>
<p>of Spain won the sixth stage of the Tour of Catalonia over 160</p>
<p>km between Casa Tarradellas and Playa de Aro on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chris Boardman of Britain continues as overall leader.</p>
</text>
